{"text": "By the light of a candle he arranged her hair, finished her simple dressing, tied her wrists with a ribbon, and laid the body on the table. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he sat down at the table, laid his arms upon it, and dropped his face into them, still tearless and unutterably weary. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At that moment a long, wailing sound like the cry of a lost child came through the open window from the far depths of the darkening wood. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the man did not move, and he did not hear it, for Murlock, worn out by three days of nursing and grief, was fast asleep. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Some hours later he lifted his head from his arms and listened intently, though he could not tell what sound had awakened him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He strained his eyes in the black darkness and silently asked himself who or what had waked him, and where it could be now. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly the table shook beneath his arms, and at the same moment he heard, or thought he heard, a light, soft step upon the floor. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then came another step, and then sounds as of bare feet moving softly across the wooden floor of the dark cabin.", "alignment": {"characters": ["B", "y", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "l", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "a", " ", "c", "a", "n", "d", "l", "e", " ", "h", "e", " ", "a", "r", "r", "a", "n", "g", "e", "d", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "h", "a", "i", "r", ",", " ", "f", "i", "n", "i", "s", "h", "e", "d", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "s", "i", "m", "p", "l", "e", " ", "d", "r", "e", "s", "s", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "t", "i", "e", "d", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "w", "r", "i", "s", "t", "s", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", " ", "r", "i", "b", "b", "o", "n", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "l", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "d", "y", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "a", "b", "l", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0